      "title": "Mtwara Buildings",
      "description": "This building data was collected in Mtwara as part of the data collection process to support the digitization of buildings, roads, and waste accumulation sites. The data was collected through drone imagery to obtain information on the location, size, and condition of buildings in Mtwara.. [Source: This metadata record was automatically extracted from the GeoNode portal resilienceacademy]",
