        "description": "The report which was produced after collecting this data includes extensive quality assurance processes to ensure the quality of the data collected. The report states that real-time data checks were carried out during mapping activities, and an extensive review of branding and litter data information was conducted. Additionally, the data was validated through a data validation workshop, where representatives from various stakeholders, including the President's Office - Regional Administration and Local Government, Mtwara Mikindani Municipal Council, Ward Executive Officers, Mtaa Executive Officers, citizens, the World Bank, OMDTZ, and FB Empowerment, discussed and confirmed the data's accuracy..",
